flowchart TB
    G[User Goal] --> L[Unrestricted Lead Agent]

    L --> C[Writes Code]
    C --> T[Runs Own Tests]
    T --> R[Reviews Own Work]
    R --> V[Validates Own Goal]
    V --> S{Something Fails?}

    S -->|Yes| M[Modify Code or Controls]
    M --> T

    S -->|No| A[Self-Approve]

    A --> D[Deploy]
